    <name>
      <text>Finding the Domain and Value of the Logarithmic Function</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Consider the function \(f(x)=\log (x)\):</p>
<p>i. Is \(x={@valx@}\) in the domain of  \(f(x)\)? [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]][[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p>ii. \(\text{Dom}(f)=\) [[input:ans2]]. Therefore, the domain is [[input:ans3]] </p>
<p></p>
<p> [[validation:ans2]][[validation:ans3]][[feedback:prt2]][[feedback:prt3]]</p>

<p><em><b>Note:</b> To enter intervals of real line, you should write the relevant text in the table below.</em></p>

